## Sources

1. W. R. Hamilton, "Second essay on a general method in dynamics", *Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society*
   125, 95–144 (1835).
2. J. Liouville, "Note sur la théorie de la variation des constantes arbitraires", *Journal de Mathématiques Pures et
   Appliquées* 3, 342–349 (1838).
3. E. Noether, "Invariante Variationsprobleme", *Nachrichten von der Gesellschaft der Wissenschaften zu Göttingen*,
   235–257 (1918). English translation by M. A. Tavel, *Transport Theory and Statistical Physics* 1, 186–207 (1971).
4. H. Goldstein, C. Poole and J. Safko, *Classical Mechanics*, 3rd ed., Addison-Wesley (2002), sections 5.7, 8.1 and
   9.9.
